WEBVTT

00:01:57.397 --> 00:02:00.916
you name it; it's on the front page
of every paper, CNN.

00:02:00.940 --> 00:02:03.433
Look at homicide
at the bottom, for God's sake.

00:02:04.338 --> 00:02:05.369
Right?

00:02:05.393 --> 00:02:06.916
(Laughter)

00:02:06.940 --> 00:02:11.916
(Applause)

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:16.256
Every single one of those in the red
is a diet-related disease.

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:18.868
Any doctor, any specialist
will tell you that.

00:02:18.892 --> 00:02:22.179
Fact: diet-related disease
is the biggest killer

00:02:22.203 --> 00:02:25.354
in the United States,
right now, here today.

00:02:28.045 --> 00:02:29.502
This is a global problem.